  differed between them is read from the survey YAML (`prompt:` block):
    survey.prompt.role              — who the respondent is
    survey.prompt.answer_rules      — survey-specific rules, appended to the list
    survey.prompt.scenario_preamble — framing shown before a vignette's text

  Override any block from surveys/<id>/prompts/answers.system.j2:
